Error [jet.ToolProviderUnavailable]: tool provider `npm` isn't available yet
 Why: the package shell spans providers, but `…@npm` has no hangar realization path yet (JPK-TOOL-PROVIDER). Built-in providers that work today: jetpack, github, and bare local paths.
 Fix: use a built-in ref (`…@jetpack`, `…@github`, or a bare local path), or wait for the `npm` provider to land.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1298
